---
layout: base.njk
title: Writing
description: Essays and short pieces by Ran Craycraft on leading through the AI era, building businesses, and making things.
permalink: /writing/
section: writing
---
<section class="page-head">
  <h1 class="serif display">Writing</h1>
  <p class="serif lede">Shorter thoughts on leading through the AI era, building businesses, and what I’m noticing along the way. The bigger milestones are under <a href="/stories/" class="ul">Stories</a>, and things I’ve built are under <a href="/making/" class="ul">Making</a>.</p>
</section>

{%- set posts = collections.posts | ofKind("writing") %}
{%- if posts.length %}
<section class="block split" aria-labelledby="here-h">
  <div>
    <h2 id="here-h" class="label">On this site</h2>
  </div>
  <ol class="list">
    {%- for p in posts %}
    <li><a href="{{ p.url }}" class="list-row stacked">
      <span class="serif list-title">{{ p.data.title }}</span>
      <span class="muted">{{ p.data.description }}</span>
      <span class="small faint">{{ p.date | readableDate }}</span>
    </a></li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>
{%- endif %}

<section class="block split" aria-labelledby="elsewhere-h">
  <div>
    <h2 id="elsewhere-h" class="label">On the thoughtbot blog</h2>
    <p class="small muted">Each links to the original.</p>
  </div>
  <ol class="list">
    {%- for e in elsewhere %}
    <li><a href="{{ e.url }}" class="list-row stacked">
      <span class="serif list-title">{{ e.title }}</span>
      <span class="muted">{{ e.summary }}</span>
      <span class="small faint">{{ e.date | readableDate }}{% if e.coauthor %} · with {{ e.coauthor }}{% endif %} · {{ e.publication }} ↗</span>
    </a></li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>
